ButtonColor0=32768
ButtonCaption0=1
TextA0=Brick: No Structural Defects<vbCrLf>Pipe: No Structural Defects
TextB0=Acceptable Structural Condition
TextOrder0=1
ButtonOrder0=32768

ButtonColor1=16711680
ButtonCaption1=2
TextA1=Brick: Minor cracking, Surface mortar loss, Spalling slight, wear slight<vbCrLf>Pipe: Circumfrential crack, Moderate joint defects, Spalling slight, Wear slight
TextB1=Minor collapse risk in short term but potential for further deterioration
TextOrder1=2
ButtonOrder1=16711680

ButtonColor2=33023
ButtonCaption2=3
TextA2=Brick: Total mortorloss without other defects, single brick displaced, Deformation up to 5%, Spalling medium, Wear medium<vbCrLf>Pipe: Fractures with deformation up tp 5%, Longitudinal cracking or mulitlpe cracking, Minor loss of level, More severe joint defects, Spalling medium, Wear medium
TextB2=! Collapse unlikely in near future but future deterioration likely !
TextOrder2=3
ButtonOrder2=33023

ButtonColor3=16711935
ButtonCaption3=4
TextA3=Brick: Total mortorloss with deformation greater than 10%, Deformation up to 10% and fractured, Displaced/hanging brickwork, Small number of missing bricks<vbCrLf>Pipe: Broken, Deformation up to 10% and broken,, Fractured with deformation 5 - 10%, Multiple fractures, Serious loss of level, spalling large, wear large
TextB3=!! Collapse likely in foreseeable future !!
TextOrder3=4
ButtonOrder3=16711935

