ButtonCaption4=5
TextA4=Brick: Already Collapsed, Missing invert, Deformation over 10% and fractured, Displaced/hanging brickwork and deformation over 10%, Extensive missing bricks<vbCrLf>Pipe: Already collapsed,  Deformation over 10% and broken, Extensive areas of fabric missing, Fractured with deformation over 10%
TextB4=!!! Collapsed or collapse imminent !!!
TextOrder4=5
